{"id":"nariz","lemma":"nariz","pos":"noun","rank":1085,"glosses":["nose (a protuberance on the face housing the nostrils, which are used to breathe or smell)","nose; smell (sense of smell)"],"ipa":"/naˈɾiθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"narices"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-nariz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo una nariz muy pequeña.","en":"I have a very small nose.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1252978","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"small","l":"pequeño"}]},{"text":"Él tiene una nariz larga.","en":"He has a long nose.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38293","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"long","l":"largo"}]},{"text":"¿Qué narices estás haciendo en mi habitación?","en":"What on earth are you doing in my room?","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"room"}]},{"text":"No puedo respirar por la nariz.","en":"I can't breathe through my nose.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537984","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to breathe"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Fue raro de narices.","en":"It was extremely weird.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460964","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"rare"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}